meta {
  name: administrator
  seq: 4
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessTokenAdmin}}
}

docs {
  The admin dashboard API. Needs an admin bearer token -- run
  **authentication > login** as `master@vidaverde.test` / `vidaverde123` first.

  Two roles:

  - **manager** -- runs the school: teachers, students, packages, blogs,
    testimonials, bookings, sessions, calendar, leads, contact messages.
  - **master** -- all of the above, plus the `admins/` endpoints.

  A manager calling an `admins/` route gets
  `{"success": false, "message": "(detail) Only a master admin can perform this action."}`.

  Deletes are deactivations wherever a row is referenced by history: teachers and
  packages flip `active` to false rather than disappearing. Blog posts really are
  deleted.
}
